  "pages": [
    {
      "sort": 100000,
      "name": "The Mall-Rats Who Inherited the Earth",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "uAcopE4BlfGJwYnR",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h2>Who They Are</h2><p data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"443\">The Tanneritos are not scavengers.</p><p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"466\">They are <strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"465\">tenants</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"507\">When the world ended, they stayed open.</p><p data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"652\">They believe — sincerely — that the apocalypse was a <em data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"581\">market correction</em>, and that anyone who survives long enough to reach the mall is either:</p><ul data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"709\"><li data-section-id=\"jhhxq9\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"666\"><p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"666\">a customer,</p></li><li data-section-id=\"vlmfd6\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"682\"><p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"682\">a contractor,</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1br5lm\" data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"709\"><p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"709\">or a limited-time event.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"968\">They speak in slang that is half ritual, half defense mechanism.<br data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"778\" />They wear improvised armor made of hockey pads, chain wallets, CD shards, and enchanted windbreakers.<br data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"882\" />They ride <strong data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"920\">giant attack skateboards</strong> that hum with soft power and suppressed trauma.</p><p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1054\">Leadership rotates constantly, because permanence is uncool and authority is cringe.</p><p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1144\">Their spiritual center is <strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1107\">The Assistant Manager</strong> — a mythical, never-seen entity who:</p><ul data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1240\"><li data-section-id=\"1ogvtyx\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1165\"><p data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1165\"><em data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1155\">almost</em> shows up,</p></li><li data-section-id=\"4cjq0z\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1193\"><p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1193\"><em data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1180\">definitely</em> left a note,</p></li><li data-section-id=\"542h09\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1240\"><p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1240\">and is <em data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1215\">absolutely</em> going to fix this later.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1245\" /><h2>Why They’re Here (Motivations)</h2><p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1322\">The Tanneritos didn’t come to the Mall.</p><p data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1347\">They woke up in it.</strong></p><p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1460\">When reality fractured, a fragment of the <strong data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1419\">Collective Teenage Dream</strong> collapsed inward — crystallizing around:</p><ul data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1579\"><li data-section-id=\"111ekts\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1492\"><p data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1492\">a stack of magical VHS tapes,</p></li><li data-section-id=\"jkqffe\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1520\"><p data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1520\">a functioning food court,</p></li><li data-section-id=\"far4m3\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1579\"><p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1579\">and the idea that <em data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1578\">nothing is permanent, but vibes are</em>.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1601\">They remain because:</p><ul data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1755\"><li data-section-id=\"oeni9l\" data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1651\"><p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1651\">Leaving feels like admitting the dream is over.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1b3v5rx\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1687\"><p data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1687\">The Mall still provides (barely).</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1051wdl\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1755\"><p data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1755\">And someone has to remember what “fun” was supposed to feel like.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1800\">They know about the <strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1791\">Valhaulans</strong> because:</p><ul data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1915\"><li data-section-id=\"1sc10cu\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1861\"><p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1861\">Valhaulan expeditions passed through the Mall decades ago.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"o0f2ln\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1896\"><p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1896\">They traded stories for shelter.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1eazh5v\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1915\"><p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1915\">Some never left.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1974\">There are <strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1935\">maps</strong> recorded on tapes labeled things like:</p><blockquote data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2045\"><p data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2045\"><em data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2008\">“Road Trip But It Gets Weird”</em><br data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2011\" /><em data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2045\">“Senior Year (Director’s Cut)”</em></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2110\">They’ll trade that information — but only once trust is earned.</p><h2>Internal Culture</h2><p data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2932\"><strong data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2932\">Values</strong></p><ul data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"3022\"><li data-section-id=\"16ciqux\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2953\"><p data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2953\">Chill is currency.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"gvweu7\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2981\"><p data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2981\">Authority must be ironic.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1mx8cwb\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3022\"><p data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3022\">Sincerity is dangerous — but rewarded.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3047\"><strong data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3047\">Conflict Resolution</strong></p><ul data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3119\"><li data-section-id=\"1v7rrzy\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3067\"><p data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3067\">Skate challenges.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"u5h88q\" data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3081\"><p data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3081\">Dance-offs.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"19xxims\" data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3119\"><p data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3119\">Passive-aggressive merch placement.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3133\"><strong data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3133\">Faith (Soul)</strong></p><ul data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3241\"><li data-section-id=\"1a79ler\" data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3160\"><p data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3160\">VHS tapes are scripture.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"lx0vfj\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3195\"><p data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3195\">The Food Court is sacred ground.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1y8o4fd\" data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3241\"><p data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3241\">The Assistant Manager is real. Don’t laugh.</p></li></ul>"
      },
